                                "sense_id": "ef45a905-27c8-34e3-8ebf-4b331e971852",
                                "text": "Carrying this reasoning to its ultimate conclusion, the Dalradians can be considered as including the Central Highland Division as its basal unit and the late Proterozoic Southern Highland Group at its top (the classification adopted here; Table 2.2), covering a time span of at least 200 Ma and possibly much more."
